<title>USA: AT&amp;T Corp Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T Corp Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.69		    $0.85</p>
<p> Net		    1,126,000		1,362,000</p>
<p> Revs		  13,048,000	     12,850,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     1,628,000		1,608,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: For quarters ended March 31.</p>
<p>The 1996 Q1 net includes a charge of $107 million, or $0.07 a share, from discontinued operations. Operating earnings without this charge were $0.92 a share.</p>
<p>First Call Q1 1997 estimate was $0.69.</p>
</text>
